 * Auxiliary Constructions:
: Points


 * Proof steps:
001. DA = DB [00] & DE = DA [02] & DB = DC [01] ⇒  C,E,B,A are concyclic [08]
002. C,E,B,A are concyclic [08] ⇒  ∠BEC = ∠BAC [09]
003. G,E,B are collinear [07] & G,C,A are collinear [06] & BE ⟂ AC [03] ⇒  BG ⟂ GA [10]
004. B,A,F are collinear [04] & FB = FA [05] ⇒  F is midpoint of BA [11]
005. BG ⟂ GA [10] & F is midpoint of BA [11] ⇒  AF = GF [12]
006. AF = GF [12] ⇒  ∠FAG = ∠AGF [13]
007. C,G,A are collinear [06] & G,E,B are collinear [07] & ∠BEC = ∠BAC [09] & ∠FAG = ∠AGF [13] & B,A,F are collinear [04] ⇒  ∠CGF = ∠GEC [14]
008. C,G,A are collinear [06] & G,E,B are collinear [07] & AC ⟂ BE [03] ⇒  CG ⟂ GE [15]
009. ∠CGF = ∠GEC [14] & CG ⟂ GE [15] ⇒  CE ⟂ FG
